At Flix, we offer a dynamic work environment with competitive pay, strong growth opportunities, and a tech-driven approach to making travel more accessible, sustainable, and affordable. &nbsp;

To strengthen our team in Ukraine, we are looking for a motivated and driven Shift Leader (m/f/d) for our FlixBus shop at the Kyiv Bus Station. You will lead the day-to-day running of your shift, guide and support the shop team, and ensure high-quality service and smooth operations for our passengers. This is a full-time, permanent position, working on a shift basis across the full week, including weekdays and weekends.&nbsp; &nbsp;

About the Role &nbsp;

• Shift Coordination: organize tasks and objectives (quality, sales, team development) at the start of each shift and ensure follow-up throughout the day &nbsp;

• Operational Oversight: ensure smooth shift operations, with a focus on team well-being, safety, customer satisfaction, and uniform compliance &nbsp;

• Service Quality: maintain a high standard of customer service and step in to resolve complex passenger questions, cancellations, and rebookings &nbsp;

• Closing Procedures: oversee cash handling and cash counts, and secure end-of-shift processes and daily reconciliation &nbsp;

• Team Support: provide hands-on support to the team during busy periods, delays, and operational disruptions, in coordination with station teams &nbsp;

• Coaching &amp; Feedback: guide, motivate, and give regular feedback to team members &nbsp;

• Onboarding &amp; Training: support the integration and development of new team members &nbsp;

About You &nbsp; &nbsp;

• 2+ years of experience in customer service, retail, or operations, including sales and cash handling; leadership or shift coordination experience is a plus &nbsp;

• A natural team leader who motivates others and creates a positive, supportive shift atmosphere &nbsp;

• Calm and resilient under pressure, staying solution-oriented during busy periods and unexpected disruptions &nbsp;

• Proactive and well-organized, taking ownership of the shift and working independently when needed &nbsp;

• Strong communication and interpersonal skills &nbsp;

• Comfortable with MS Office, smartphones, web applications, and reservation systems &nbsp;

• Flexible to work shifts from Monday to Sunday

• Very good command of Ukrainian and English &nbsp;

We recognize that everyone carries a unique set of valuable skills and experiences. If you think you could have an impact even though you don't meet 100% of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply. We want to hear from you! &nbsp;

What We Offer &nbsp;

• Travel perks: 12 free Flix vouchers + 12 discount vouchers for friends &amp; family &nbsp;

• Wellbeing support: Access confidential 1:1 counselling, courses, and stress management for yourself and up to four family members &nbsp;

• Learning &amp; Development: Take advantage of language classes, training courses, and expert-led sessions to grow your skills &nbsp;

• Mentoring Program: Connect with experienced colleagues to gain insights and accelerate your career &nbsp;

Why Join Flix? &nbsp;

At Flix, you’ll find teams that rally together to overcome challenges and spark creativity. We believe in ownership culture - giving you the freedom to take initiative, make an impact, and shape your own career path. As we continue to expand across the globe, you can make a real difference in how we work. &nbsp;

If you’re ready to grow and lead your journey, Flix is the place for you! &nbsp;

